Hackers,

I installed pl7 today (fun thing to do on Saturday),  but I did find
one TEENY bug (so far).  The final patch (30) has the following statement
ath the end:

cp /dev/null ark1isdone

It should read:

cp /dev/null ark30isdone

The end result is that when you install patch 30, it tells you that
you still need to unpack archive 30.

So either change the line,  or ignore the final message.  

Otherwise,  everything went loaded up perfectly.

